     "note": "PARTLY-FIXED - CORRECTS THE RECORD: the no-detector half is dispositioned at geom.c:69-77 as unreachable-in-tree defence-in-depth in the vacuity taxonomy, NOT as an equivalent mutant (that list is a separate paragraph at :63-67, and the guard is deliberately not in it). Half 1 measured REAL: both strtoll calls pass NULL endptr, so digits+garbage is accepted.",
