     "outcome_note": "The no-surviving-caller conclusion is confirmed by the witness's 2026-08-27 reading and adopted by fable5 assess/review 2026-08-29. The later hold also preserves the finding that exitsweep does not change these callers. [graded by codex gpt-6-astra max, n9, 2026-09-19]"
