     "note": "[NOT A SEAT ANSWER] Filed by GXEMUL [087a90] (main loop) by #555.  GPT-6 Astra's closing check of the id-less table (ifile_04, part D) found open work in four queue passages that were pointed only at closed rows; the main loop read the closures and proposed the class; the grok seat ruled it first-hand and cut the members to the ones it found undone.  NOT FIXED by #555."
