     "ev": "regress/artifacts/armmmuvehicle/pass1_20261009/opus5/opus5_pass1.md",
     "note": "VERDICT: BUILD WITH CHANGES (9) -- the vehicle WORKS on unmodified `-E testarm` (MMU on and stepping in section 0; data and prefetch aborts reach handlers via 0x10/0x0c with LR/SPSR/FSR/FAR exactly as predicted -- all MEASURED), but two premises are wrong (`dump` cannot see the c8 hole; `put h` is e  Measured (a)-(f): the vehicle works, aborts reach 0x10/0x0c with the predicted LR/SPSR/FSR/FAR; the proposed rows catch 1 of 11 one-edit mutants, its nine changes the other ten; dump cannot see the c8 hole; put h has exceptions on; build on arm_bdt_probe.py's prompt-detecting send(), not msrmode's fixed delays (gate 6).  Found: armvecrecurse (HIGH, host SIGSEGV)."
