ld\u0027 is FALSE -- _images/wdc-scratch-64m.img attached `ciR:\u0027 reports \u0027IDE CD-ROM id 0, read-only\u0027; the c is a PREFIX. ***  _4bit\u0027s variadic legs already accept one; its single-leg form is a NEW ORACLE choice, not a mode.  SEVEN obligations, not six: gate_offline.sh:1084 SM_EXEMPT fbpending_bound:2026-09-20, enforced at :1165 -- and it is the only genuinely cheap one.  The ledger\u0027s EIGHT was correct when written (8 -\u003e 7 -\u003e 6, two discharges on 2026-08-30): an expired measurement, not a transcription.  AND THE POPULATION GROWS THROUGH AN UNDATED DOOR: \u003e= 8 of 18 CLASS_WITNESS entries are post-fix-green (the checker\u0027s own definition of a detector), invisible because un-gated witnesses render `not run (correct)\u0027; today\u0027s lca_irqstub_probe.py note is an instance.  Three of its own derivers failed and were caught by contradictions between its own outputs -- recorded in its answer."
