                            "ev":  "regress/artifacts/ip30abortkill/probe_HEAD_15row_20260917.out; regress/artifacts/ip30abortkill/probe_FIX531_final_20260917.out; regress/artifacts/ip30abortkill/REPIN_prefix_20260917.out; src/devices/dev_sgi_ip30.c",
                            "note":  "*** FIXED AND MEASURED 2026-09-17 AS `#531`.  PRE-FIX 11/18 -\u003e POST-FIX 18/18 [18-ROW INSTRUMENT, SUPERSEDED BY 8/21 -\u003e 21/21 -- see the correction at the end of this note], with the re-pin\u0027s own red measured separately at 8/18 [the order proof, which STAYS on the 18-row form by design]. ***  All four guest-reachable `abort()` calls de-fatalised; live `abort()` 4 -\u003e 0, `return` statements 6 -\u003e 6 (no early return, the common tail still runs). **The disposition was settled by `heart.h`, the header this file cites three times**: `set_isr`/`clear_isr` are write-side (member 4 on WRITE, member 3 on READ) and `isr` is READ-ONLY, so `0x10030`\u0027s clear-on-write is dropped -- *the file\u0027s own \"TODO: is this correct?\" answered NO by its own source*. **Two L1 row defects the fix exposed, both repaired in-round:** `acc 20000` expected a counter not to count (`0x161c - 0x1234 = 1000` exactly, the tick stride) and was RED ON A CORRECT BUILD; `isr keep` read the FIRST of three loads instead of the last, invisible pre-fix because its seeding write aborted. **OWED BEFORE CLOSE: panel pass 2 on the real diff.**  *** THE FIGURES IN THIS NOTE ARE SUPERSEDED AND ARE CORRECTED HERE RATHER THAN REWRITTEN, so the record shows what was claimed and when.  `PRE-FIX 11/18 -\u003e POST-FIX 18/18\u0027 was a correct measurement of the 18-ROW instrument, taken before pass 2.  Pass 2 then found four defects; repairing them added `tick 50 txt\u0027, re-bound `kill 30 txt\u0027, and added the two floor rows `isr clr\u0027 and `isr drop 30\u0027, growing the instrument to 21 rows.  THE ROUND\u0027S FIGURES ARE 8/21 PRE-FIX (PREFIX_21row_20260917.out) AND 21/21 POST-FIX (probe_FIX531_21row_20260917.out), both on that one instrument.  Note also that this note\u0027s `OWED BEFORE CLOSE: panel pass 2\u0027 line is DISCHARGED -- the pass ran, did not ratify, and its findings are recorded in the review entries on this row. ***"
