CHANGELOG.md:21661:| `core/emul.c` | #3, #4, #42, #60 | `system()` gzip → `fork`/exec (no shell injection); `tmpstr[20]→[32]`; **#42** prefer `/bin/gunzip` and `/usr/bin/gunzip`, with a PATH lookup fallback and the inherited environment retained, plus the `fd != STDOUT_FILENO` close guard and the `--` option-injection guard [#560]; **#60** pass the `mkstemp` fd to the child & `dup2` it instead of reopening by name (closes the same-user temp race) |
